  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Credit Facility for the Caribbean Development Bank</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The Project aims at: (i)Promoting and financing new sustainable infrastructure projects in the Caribbean region (indicatively, in the sectors of energy, transport, water and sanitation and climate change mitigation), and (ii)Reinforcing the national implementing agencies for the seeding and follow-up of new projects. Specifically the Project will aim at resolving the issue of maintaining a solid pipeline of quality projects within the borrowing member countries. &lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
